246
00:27:57,791 --> 00:28:20,960
And soon, not long after his full admission, dwelling alone, withdrawn, diligent, ardent and resolute, the Venerable Margandia, by realizing for himself with direct knowledge, here and now, entered upon and abided in that supreme goal of the holy life, for the sake of which Klansmen rightly go forth from the home into homelessness.

247
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:22,721
He directly knew

248
00:28:23,073 --> 00:28:24,315
